cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Siderust for Python in scientific work, cite this package, the Siderust Rust core, and the astronomical models and datasets relevant to your analysis."
type: software
title: "Siderust for Python: Rust-backed Astrometry and Astrodynamics"
abstract: "Python bindings for Siderust, providing Rust-backed, reference-frame-aware astrometry, celestial coordinates, ephemerides, observation planning, and astrodynamics."
authors:
